{
  "grammar": "yaml",
  "note": [
    "Transcribed from tree-sitter-yaml's scanner.c read as a specification.",
    "Nothing is linked. Line references are to the pinned copy under",
    ".local/differential/lang/yaml/src/scanner.c.",
    "",
    "This is the grammar the layout dossier declined three times, and the price it",
    "named is paid here in four places rather than in three new organs:",
    "",
    "1. The PAIRED TYPED indent stack is `frames`, whose element has always been a",
    "   kind beside a width. The C keeps `ind_typ_stk` and `ind_len_stk` and pushes",
    "   to both at once, which is one stack of a two-field element spelled twice.",
    "",
    "2. The LAYOUT-INDEXED ALPHABET needs no new instruction. The C computes",
    "   `has_nwl = cur_row > row` from a remembered row, but a scanner that has",
    "   soaked to the offset can read the same fact off the bytes: if a newline was",
    "   crossed, the offset is the line's first non-blank byte, so `column = lead`;",
    "   if it was not, the previous token lies on this line in front of us, so",
    "   `column > lead`. Every `is_r` below is `lead < column` and every `is_br` /",
    "   `is_b` is `lead = column` and a comparison against the frame. Measured:",
    "   `_r_*` and `_br_*` are co-admitted by shift in 10 states, so the scanner",
    "   must separate those two; `_b_*` is co-admitted by shift with neither, so",
    "   the parse state separates that one and `wanted` picks it.",
    "",
    "3. The SCHEMA CLASSIFIER is `emit ... classified by`. The C's `rlt_sch` is",
    "   below the `// temp` line in its own struct - recomputed per scan, never",
    "   serialized - so a table over the matched text is not an approximation of",
    "   it, it is the same function.",
    "",
    "4. Widths are stored SHIFTED BY ONE, because the C seeds its stack with",
    "   `IND_ROT` at width -1 (:198) and a frame width is unsigned. Root is 0 and",
    "   column c is c+1. The shift is what keeps both standing tests pure",
    "   conjunctions: `leading > cur_ind` is `lead >= frames.top.width` and",
    "   `leading == cur_ind` is `lead = frames.top.width - 1`, and both come out",
    "   right at root without an arm of their own.",
    "",
    "Three of the five registers the census counted are not memory. `row`,",
    "`col` and `blk_imp_row` exist only to answer whether the line changed:",
    "`MAY_UPD_IMP_COL` (:122) fires exactly when `blk_imp_row != bgn_row`, which",
    "is the first token of a line, which is `lead = column`. So what is left to",
    "remember is the implicit key's column and whether it was reached over a tab.",
    "",
    "Tabs in indentation are not modelled: `has_tab_ind` gates `is_b` and the two",
    "pushes, and yaml forbids a tab in indentation, so the fixture cannot reach",
    "the difference. Named here rather than left as a silence."
  ],
